ved_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-21T18:26:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T20:28:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123683","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123683.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123683.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Applies the inverse of the sky orientation to the directional lights passed to the sky shader.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #75416\r\n- Fixes the procedural sky shaders, or any sky shader that uses the light direction, of not keeping the light direction consistent when rotation is applied to the sky.\r\n- Most importantly, it also fixes an issue with a noticeable divergence showing up between the sun scatter fog effect between the sky and the rest of the scene.\r\n\r\nIn the screenshots below, the sky is rotated 80 degrees in Y.\r\n\r\nBefore\r\n<img width=\"2587\" height=\"1086\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a3a74d-e9ae-4cd3-8089-bf06217feab9\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAfter\r\n<img width=\"2617\" height=\"1088\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/784b1fca-da0a-46cd-9e08-4f95570d5455\" />\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis introduces a behavior change as to how Sky shaders work, but one that many people expressed their frustration with on the issue linked above and had to come up with workarounds to it. For example, the standard procedural sky shader will no longer rotate the sun incorrectly and will keep the sun in the same spot when rotation is applied.\r\n\r\nThis is particularly helpful for people who use environment textures and need to use rotation to adjust the texture to the intended orientation.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123683/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":11,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123683/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}